  <section id="best-for">
    <h2>Who All-Star Sports is best for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Families watching the nightly rate.</strong> In 2026 a Standard Room ran about $149 to $311 a night at full price, tax included, which is the lowest starting Standard rate of the three All-Stars.</li>
      <li><strong>Parties of four who can live with a Value room.</strong> Official listings show a queen bed and a queen-size table bed.</li>
      <li><strong>Anyone fine with a food court and a bus.</strong> That's the whole transportation and dining picture here.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Think twice if…</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>You need a room for five or six.</strong> There are no family suites at All-Star Sports. Look at All-Star Music or Art of Animation instead.</li>
      <li><strong>You want a sit-down restaurant at the hotel.</strong> There's a food court and a pool bar, and that's it.</li>
      <li><strong>You want Extended Evening Hours.</strong> Value resort guests don't get them.</li>
      <li><strong>You don't want to walk.</strong> Book a Preferred room, closer to Stadium Hall. Standard rooms can be a longer walk.</li>
    </ul>
