  <section id="rooms">
    <h2>Room types, sizes and beds</h2>
    <p>There are two categories, and they are the same room. You are paying for location, not a different layout. Official room listings describe views of the courtyard, pool or parking area. Preferred rooms are listed as close to Stadium Hall, dining, shopping and transportation.</p>
