  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>End Zone Food Court</strong> is the quick-service restaurant, in Stadium Hall. It is the only place on site for a full breakfast, lunch or dinner.</li>
      <li><strong>Grandstand Spirits Pool Bar</strong> sits by the Surfboard Bay Pool.</li>
      <li>There is no table-service restaurant at this resort.</li>
      <li>You can use mobile ordering in the My Disney Experience app at the quick-service spots.</li>
      <li><strong>Park dining reservations:</strong> Disney resort guests can book their whole stay (up to 10 nights) starting 60 days before arrival.</li>
    </ul>
