  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Surfboard Bay Pool</strong> is the main pool. Official pages list it at 242,471 gallons and describe a beach-style pool lined with giant, three-story surfboards. A kiddie pool is behind Stadium Hall, next to this pool.</li>
      <li><strong>Grand Slam Pool</strong> is the second pool, shaped like a baseball diamond. Official pages describe a sporty sundeck and large baseball-bat icons around the deck. Gallonage is not listed on the official pool page we opened.</li>
      <li>Towels are free at the pools. Hours and lifeguard coverage vary and can change.</li>
    </ul>
